          "_name": "features029",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features029\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' &amp;&amp; bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked=\"\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n    <header>Card</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked=\"\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Subtitle\" name=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButtons\" title=\"Buttons\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected=\"\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax=\"\">\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax=\"\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected=\"\">\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked=\"\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline=\"\" title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay &amp;&amp; bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showText\">\n      <div class=\"col-md-12 content-head mb-5\">\n        <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style  mb-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b><i>為何選擇靜宜觀光 ?</i></b></h1>\n        <p class=\"mbr-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-4 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-subtitle\">\n          Great for pro-coders for fast prototyping and small customers' projects.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-6\">\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>其實當初我更想要選的是教育相關的科系，尤其是台中教育大學的幼兒教育系，但是當時的高中班導覺得我的個性外向、活潑而且不怕生，更適合進入觀光業服務。原本的我對觀光系一無所知，不過與當時班導聊完之後，我覺得自己確實很適合觀光系。我發現自己喜歡表達和參與，也喜歡認識、了解不同個性的人，更經常在路邊幫助他人。在兩次擔任班長的過程中意識到自己善於領導、溝通。在寒、暑假或連假時，也喜歡自己安排行程與家人體驗不同的新鮮事。在幫助別人或是規劃行程帶領別人的過程中，我都感覺到強烈的成就感以及被需要的幸福感，因此決定選擇靜宜大學觀光系。且靜宜大學觀光系除了積極建立良好的實習環境外，也十分重視與業界的互動，讓我相當期待成為一個熱情有活力、剛毅務實、秉持服務精神的觀光人。<br></b><br></p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6\">\n        \n        \n        <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12 active\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-content\">\n              <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3 mbr-number\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-number\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\"></h5>\n              <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                <b>Meaning</b>\n              </h4>\n              <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-0\" data-app-selector=\".card-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                The journey concludes as we uncover the profound meaning within our creations, making\n                them truly resonate.\n              </p>\n              <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons=\"\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                <a href=\"\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-white\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn more</a>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-content\">\n              <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3 mbr-number\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-number\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\"></h5>\n              <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                <b>Meaning</b>\n              </h4>\n              <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-0\" data-app-selector=\".card-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                The journey concludes as we uncover the profound meaning within our creations, making\n                them truly resonate.\n              </p>\n              <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons=\"\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                <a href=\"\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-white\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn more</a>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12\">\n          <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"item-content\">\n              <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3 mbr-number\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-number\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\"></h5>\n              <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                <b>Meaning</b>\n              </h4>\n              <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-0\" data-app-selector=\".card-text, .item .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                The journey concludes as we uncover the profound meaning within our creations, making\n                them truly resonate.\n              </p>\n              <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons=\"\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                <a href=\"\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-white\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn more</a>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vxfTSbIrvl",
          "_anchor": "features029-2",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor"
